  "findings": [
    "DH shared value is not a traffic key; unauthenticated DH permits active MITM; DLP and CDH are distinct problems.",
    "RSA e=1 passes the stated coprimality condition but exposes plaintext; specify distinct odd primes and representative range.",
    "Euler proof needs coprimality; all representatives require primewise zero/nonzero proof and CRT.",
    "Factoring N suffices to recover d; attacks need not factor N. Raw modular exponentiation is not OAEP/PSS.",
    "Unsupported generic RSA-1024 factored assertion and universal current key policy; replace with explicitly dated security-strength comparison.",
    "Finite-field nonsingularity must be modulo p>3; point at infinity, inverses and y=0 doubling missing.",
    "Doubling is a special case of scalar multiplication; require subgroup order and private scalar range.",
    "Generic Pollard rho estimate is not a lower-bound proof and special curves can be weak.",
    "Unsupported universal ECC performance/market and PQC guarantees; distinguish TLS1.3 key agreement, signatures, bulk AEAD.",
    "Japanese conclusion contains mixed Bengali corruption."
  ],
